module jev_calibration_convergence_gate_lsp_repair_action_closure_metric

stage declaration
stage ir
stage generated
stage repair_action
stage reverse_observation
stage evidence_prefix

status BOUND when all stages and digests match
status UNKNOWN when a stage is missing or a digest is tampered
status DEFERRED when a producer is not explicitly BOUND

rule no_execution
rule no_authorization
rule preserve_missing_stage_index